---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /teaching/
active: teaching
bodyClass: on-paper
title: Teaching
description: "Organ, piano and music theory at California Lutheran University and the Colburn School, plus masterclasses, residencies and workshops for parish musicians."
---
<section class="page-head split">
  <div class="wrap">
  <div class="head-text">
    <p class="eyebrow">Teaching</p>
    <h1>From the studio to the <em>choir loft.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ teaching.intro }}</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="head-photo"><img src="/assets/img/press/conducting-orchestra-web.jpg" alt="Adán Fernández conducting" width="638" height="638" style="object-position:50% 20%" loading="eager"></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cards numbered">
    {%- for a in teaching.areas %}
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3>{{ a.title }}</h3>
        <p class="fine" style="margin:-.2rem 0 .8rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--brass-deep)">{{ a.place }}</p>
        <p>{{ a.body }}</p>
      </div>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">The choirs</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <div class="choir-strip">
      <figure class="reveal" style="--ar:1.664"><img src="/assets/img/press/choir-loft.jpg" alt="Adán Fernández's adult choir singing in the choir loft" width="1206" height="725" loading="lazy"></figure>
      <figure class="reveal" style="--ar:0.801"><img src="/assets/img/press/altar-choir.jpg" alt="Adán Fernández conducting choir and orchestra before the altar" width="1206" height="1506" loading="lazy"></figure>
      <figure class="reveal" style="--ar:0.805"><img src="/assets/img/press/childrens-choir.jpg" alt="Adán Fernández conducting a children's choir" width="1206" height="1499" loading="lazy"></figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dark">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="rule-head"><span class="lbl">Beyond the studio</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <h2>What he brings on the <em>road.</em></h2>
      <figure class="portrait-frame" style="margin:2rem 0 0;max-width:440px">
        <img src="/assets/img/press/gys-orchestra.jpg" alt="Adán Fernández conducting the Glendale Youth Symphony" width="1206" height="792" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <ul class="pills">
      {%- for o in teaching.offers %}<li>{{ o }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="rule-head" style="margin-top:2.4rem"><span class="lbl">Courses he has taught</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <ul class="pills">
      {%- for o in teaching.courses %}<li>{{ o }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-brass" href="/contact/">Ask about teaching</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
